Founders: Ed Felten (Co-founder & Chief Scientist); Steven Goldfeder (Co-founder & CEO); Harry Kalodner (Co-founder & CTO) — semuanya bertemu di Princeton University (HIGH) [Messari, https://messari.io/project/arbitrum/profile; Bitstamp, https://www.bitstamp.net/learn/cryptocurrency-guide/what-is-arbitrum/; Blockchain.com, https://www.blockchain.com/learning-portal/tokens/arbitrum-explained; Uphold, https://uphold.com/en-eu/prices/crypto/arbitrum]

