Launch Date - Testnet: Februari 2020 (HIGH) [Messari, https://messari.io/project/arbitrum/profile; CoinMarketCap, https://coinmarketcap.com/community/articles/66801de7b3e9e537375b33bb/] — dibuka untuk semua peserta pada Oktober 2020 (HIGH) [Messari, https://messari.io/project/arbitrum/profile]

Launch Date - Mainnet: 31 Agustus 2021 (Arbitrum One — public launch untuk semua pengguna dan protokol) (HIGH) [Messari, https://messari.io/project/arbitrum/profile; Blockchain.com, https://www.blockchain.com/learning-portal/tokens/arbitrum-explained; CoinMarketCap, https://coinmarketcap.com/community/articles/66801de7b3e9e537375b33bb/] — sebelumnya mainnet untuk developer pada Mei 2021 (HIGH) [Messari, https://messari.io/project/arbitrum/profile; CoinMarketCap, https://coinmarketcap.com/community/articles/66801de7b3e9e537375b33bb/]

Launch Date - TGE: 23 Maret 2023 (token generation event / airdrop claim) (HIGH) [Blockchain.com, https://www.blockchain.com/learning-portal/tokens/arbitrum-explained; Uphold, https://uphold.com/en-eu/prices/crypto/arbitrum] — pengumuman resmi ARB pada 16 Maret 2023 (HIGH) [Uphold, https://uphold.com/en-eu/prices/crypto/arbitrum]

Main Products: Arbitrum One (general-purpose optimistic rollup); Arbitrum Nova (AnyTrust chain untuk gaming dan social apps); Arbitrum Nitro (tech stack — upgrade Agustus 2022); Arbitrum Orbit (framework untuk custom L2/L3 chains — Oktober 2023 mainnet-ready); Stylus (programming language yang memungkinkan Rust dkk. di Arbitrum — alpha testnet Januari 2024) (HIGH) [Messari, https://messari.io/project/arbitrum/profile; Arbitrum Docs, https://docs.arbitrum.io; CoinMarketCap, https://coinmarketcap.com/community/articles/66801de7b3e9e537375b33bb/]

